# Git Workflow

- Do not commit unless explicitly asked.
- Never commit `.env`, tokens, MSAL cache, or `.venv/`.
- Review `data/catalog/` changes for PII before committing.
- Prefer focused commits with clear messages.
- Do not force-push to main/master without explicit approval.
- Keep `config/team.yaml.example` updated when team schema changes.
